onship does not supply or retract a global result.',counterevidence=[],limitations=resolution['scope_limitations'],challenged_components=[])\ns=dict(action='review',artifact_id=new['id'],rationale='Review new actual transport comparison and resolve the exact map-origin applicability issue on the earlier local result.',review_items=[item,olditem],resolutions=[resolution],feedback=dict(ref_ids=['0485c6c015bc4645a45e0f815f23a3f0','60e27f33b9834b7d87fa2fe866557a2e',new['id'],old['id'],cid,oldcid,'S_prepare_codec','S_prepare_new','S_prepare'],answered='The new clean-copy run reports producer value ballot 1 at event 3 and decoded value ballot 0 at event 5 for the same Prepare reply. Current correspondence found no issue with the actual producer, legal separate-channel dispatch, synchronous sample or exact field comparison. The prior phase run separately reports Status 2 after acknowledgment where Status 3 is required; its vbal=0 and serialized Status make the new codec discovery independent of that existing comparison. The exact map-origin applicability issue is answered without modifying either artifact.',remaining=['Neither local result executes later recovery selection or demonstrates conflicting decisions.','The independent self-vbal update and the wider recovery-choice question remain open.'],understanding='updated',rationale='Associate each result with its own execution and retain the wider uncertainty rather than combining two local defects into an unobserved consensus failure.',question_updates={cid:dict(unknowns=['Whether the lost value-ballot context changes a recovery decision in a producer-derived history, considering the independent local self-vbal rule.'],resume_conditions=[])}))\nopen('wire_review.json','w').write(json.dumps(s,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\np=subprocess.run(r['validation']['command']+['wire_review.json'],capture_output=True,text=True);print(p.stdout);print(p.stderr)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
